{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263rtSYAVQW11793616293.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產馬鞍山迎海御峰分行資深區域營業經理胡耀祖表示，近期市場氣氛正面，馬鞍山聽濤雅苑本月錄約3宗成交，屋苑最新錄8座中層D室，實用面積755平方呎，3房連套房間隔，開價約880萬元，議價後以860萬元易手，實用平均呎價11,391元。</p><p> </p><p>中原胡耀祖指，新買家為換樓客，見單位間隔合用，價錢合理，即決定入市單位自用。據了解，原業主於1998年以484萬元購入單位，持貨約28年，是次轉手賬面上獲利376萬元或77.7%離場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T09:24:20.764189+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T08:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T10:58:24.785997+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T09:19:49.074046+00:00","content_hash":"70b5652dd4b4cd158ec075476e5129d69ace6ab25983e535db6a3219b841d569","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T09:24:20.764189+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}